@host = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = {{SENTINELPAY_API_KEY}}

### List providers
GET {{host}}/api/v1/providers
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Authorize a payment
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-create-0001
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "merchantReference": "order-2026-0001",
  "amountMinor": 12990,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "provider": "mock-bank",
  "paymentMethodToken": "tok_visa"
}

### Use tok_declined or tok_insufficient_funds to exercise failure paths.

### Capture part of the authorization
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/capture
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-capture-0001
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "amountMinor": 5000
}

### Use tok_3ds_challenge with mock-bank or tok_http_3ds with acquirer-http for 3DS.
